      "blockId": "paragraph:play-a-sound-using-a-mixer:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code creates a [`PHASEChannelMixerDefinition`](phasechannelmixerdefinition.md) and passes it into a node definition the app can invoke to play the channel-based audio file `drumloopSoundAsset`:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code creates a [`PHASEChannelMixerDefinition`](phasechannelmixerdefinition.md) and passes it into a node definition the app can invoke to play the channel-based audio file `drumloopSoundAsset`:",
      "sourceHash": "3c4cb87bab9b4a0e3a80e7b9bfb814723f7395068b2c949fb265ae5d71d27071",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "To play a sound using a mixer, create a mixer definition and pass it to a sound event.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\n// Create a channel mixer definition.\nlet stereoMixer = PHASEChannelMixerDefinition(channelLayout:stereoLayout!)\n\n// Pass the mixer to a sound event node definition that plays an audio file.\nlet drumloopSamplerNode = PHASESamplerNodeDefinition(soundAssetIdentifier:drumloopSoundAsset.identifier, mixerDefinition:stereoMixer, identifier:\"drumloopNode\")\n```",
      "documentTitle": "PHASEMixerDefinition",
      "framework": "PHASE",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
