      "id": "seg:code:play-a-sound-using-a-mixer:0012:0001",
      "blockId": "code:play-a-sound-using-a-mixer:0012",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\n// Create a channel mixer definition.\nlet stereoMixer = PHASEChannelMixerDefinition(channelLayout:stereoLayout!)\n\n// Pass the mixer to a sound event node definition that plays an audio file.\nlet drumloopSamplerNode = PHASESamplerNodeDefinition(soundAssetIdentifier:drumloopSoundAsset.identifier, mixerDefinition:stereoMixer, identifier:\"drumloopNode\")\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```swift // Create a channel mixer definition. let stereoMixer = PHASEChannelMixerDefinition(channelLayout:stereoLayout!) // Pass the mixer to a sound event node definition that plays an audio file. let drumloopSamplerNode = PHASESamplerNodeDefinition(soundAssetIdentifier:drumloopSoundAsset.identifier, mixerDefinition:stereoMixer, identifier:\"drumloopNode\") ```",
      "sourceHash": "dda43c5ccc433ce34ba833990d91133428695bf93a12241aae70ec800d5c831a",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "The following code creates a [`PHASEChannelMixerDefinition`](phasechannelmixerdefinition.md) and passes it into a node definition the app can invoke to play the channel-based audio file `drumloopSoundAsset`:",
      "contextAfter": "Topics",
      "documentTitle": "PHASEMixerDefinition",
      "framework": "PHASE",
      "ko": "```swift\n// Create a channel mixer definition.\nlet stereoMixer = PHASEChannelMixerDefinition(channelLayout:stereoLayout!)\n\n// Pass the mixer to a sound event node definition that plays an audio file.\nlet drumloopSamplerNode = PHASESamplerNodeDefinition(soundAssetIdentifier:drumloopSoundAsset.identifier, mixerDefinition:stereoMixer, identifier:\"drumloopNode\")\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
